{"id": "Dcy173UgAVR", "title": "Video by theaustinschneider", "description": "Follow @theaustinschneider for more\n\n--\n\nHi, I'm Austin. I teach agency owners how to scale inside @agencyu.co. 7 years ago I started running my own agency. The advice out there? Grind harder, close more deals, just outwork everyone. It didn't work. I was doing $30K a month and still felt like I was drowning.\n\nSo over the next few years I stopped following everyone else's playbook and built my own. Hired the right people, built real systems, and got out of the day-to-day. My agency hit $200K+ months. I realized the problem was never effort — it was the missing infrastructure underneath.\n\nToday I've helped 650+ agency owners build the systems that actually let them scale. My program Agency U takes agency owners from $10K to $100K a month — without working more hours to get there.\n\nMy job is to help you stop being the bottleneck in your own business. Build the offer, the team, the ops, and the sales process that runs without you. Over $10.3M in tracked results across our clients.\n\nMy main goal in life is measured by how many agency owners I can help get their time back. If any of this resonated with you, follow @theaustinschneider and watch what happens when you stop working in your business and start building one.", "channel": "theaustinschneider", "uploader_id": "66334985400", "uploader": "Austin Schneider", "timestamp": 1788372456, "like_count": 1341, "comment_count": 70, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-17958890211209401a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 59.093, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4